---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1" />
    <meta name="description" content="Authentic Arctic cruises in Norway with Captain Mads. Discover Tromsø, Lofoten and Vesterålen aboard Norwegian Fjord Explorer." />
    <link rel="icon" type="image/png" href="/images/explorer-logo.png" />
    <title>Norwegian Fjord Explorer — Arctic Cruises · V2</title>
  </head>
  <body><main><Hero /><Experiences /><CruiseCTA /><Boat /><Routes /><Stops /><Sustainability /><About /><CrewGallery /><Documentary /><Charters /><DeckPlans /></main><Footer /><ScrollReveal /><SmoothScroll /></body>
</html>
